{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华对以色列的爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以色列年幼时，我就爱他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"视他为儿子，把他从埃及召出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，我越召唤他们，他们就跑得越远，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给巴力献祭，向偶像烧香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我教以法莲学步，张开双臂抱他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却不知道是我医治他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我用慈绳爱索牵引他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"解开他们所负的重轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弯腰喂养他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“他们要返回埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚述要统治他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不肯归向我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑之灾要临到他们的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁坏他们的城门，将他们吞噬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们倚仗自己的计谋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民执意离我而去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们虽然求告至高的我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不会救拔他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲啊，我怎能舍弃你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，我怎能弃绝你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能使你的下场如押玛？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎能对待你如对待洗扁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心意改变，我满怀怜爱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不再发烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再毁灭以法莲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是上帝，不是世人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是住在你们中间的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不带着烈怒来临。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“以色列子民必跟随耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要像狮子一样吼叫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂吼叫的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要战战兢兢地从西方来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必战战兢兢前来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像从埃及赶来的鸟儿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像从亚述飞来的鸽子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要带他们返回家园。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["对以色列和犹大的指控"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"以法莲用谎话包围我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家用诡诈环绕我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大依然背离圣洁、信实的上帝","poem":1},{"noteId":20},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":20,"caller":"+","text":"“犹大依然背离圣洁、信实的上帝”或译为“犹大却与上帝同行，忠于圣者”。","reference":{"chapter":11,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}